MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_001: Waaaaaagh! S-somebodyyy!
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_002: Promised One! Here goes! Hrah!
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_003: Hyah!
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_004: We owe you our lives! Thank you so much!
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_005: I'll go have a look for enemies that might still be\nlurking around.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_006: I have a good idea about where they might hide, so\nthis'll be over quickly.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_007: <NCA>"Very brave."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_008: Haha. I'm glad you think so, but that word doesn't\ndescribe me very well.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_009: I only know about hiding places because I'm good at\nfinding them for myself.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_010: I'm quaking in my boots right now. I just know that I\ncan't afford to let fear win.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_011: Danger is spreading even as we stand here talking.\nI'm glad we saved some folks, but there's more to do.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_012: <NCA>"Let me do the rounds instead."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_013: <NCB>"Let's do the rounds together."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_014: <ACA>So I should just go back to base? No, I can't do that.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_015: <ACB>Thank you, but I'll be alright by myself.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_016: I think it makes sense for us to split up. It'll mean we\ncan get to those in trouble that much faster.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_017: I'll head over that way. Promised One, you can take\nthe other side.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_018: Oh! Right. The signal whistles. Let me give one to\nyou too.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_019: The sound carries pretty far, so it's handy to have\na few just in case.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_020: A friend of mine was in a dangerous situation once,\nand I want to be able to rush to her side if needed.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_021: I've got one too, so just come and help me if you\nhear it.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_022: Heh. I can walk easy knowing the Promised One's\ngot my back.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_A_023: Alright. Time to finish this.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_001: Ah!
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_002: Promised One. You came to help me.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_003: You heard the signal, and you're here. Heh...\nI wasn't sure it'd work.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_004: When you disappeared, I looked everywhere for you.\nBut I couldn't find you, and... *sniffle*
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_005: <NCA>"Now, now. Don't cry."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_006: <NCB>"I rushed to your side."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_007: <ACA>I'm sorry... I can't stop...
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_008: <ACB>I'm sorry for crying.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_009: I'm such a coward at heart. I feel as if I'm still that\nweak little kid I was years ago.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_010: <NCA>"That's not true at all."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_011: Well, if I do seem stronger, it's only because you\nwere there for me.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_012: I didn't want to patrol alone. I was so scared, but I\ndid it because I knew you'd save me if I needed you.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_013: If I had any courage, it was because I knew you'd\nshield me. But I lost it when you went missing.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_014: I guess I'm just no good without you.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_015: I know this is a lot to ask, but... Do you think you can\nalways be by my side?
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_016: Oh... That makes me so happy. Ugh, I'm probably\ngonna cry again.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_017: Heh... I know I'm safe with you, but that just makes\nme want to cry even more.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_018: <NCA>"You don't need to be afraid anymore."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_019: <NCB>"There's no need to cry."
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_022: 
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_020: <RSDS>You're right. Thank you, Promised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Pet_S_021: And since we'll never be apart again, I guess I won't\nneed this whistle anymore.